  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pol 402.01 Ownership of Certificates. All certificates and documents issued by the council shall remain the property of the council, and shall be returned to the council forthwith upon revocation, suspension or expiration.\n\nSource. #1534, eff 2-17-80; ss by #1988, eff 3-25-82; ss by #2783, eff 7-27-84; ss by #4437, eff 6-22-88; ss by #5836, eff 6-15-94; ss by #7302, eff 6-8-00; ss by #9168, INTERIM, eff 6-3-08, EXPIRES: 11-30-08; ss by #9224, eff 8-1-08; ss by #12041, eff 11-16-16",
